  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Sleeps 18!<br><br>The BEST location in the amazing community of NatureWalk! NEXT DOOR TO THE POOL!<br><br>Amenities include ZERO-ENTRY pool, hot tub, nature trail to the beach, fire pits, playground, walking trails & hammocks!<br><br>6-Seater LSV/golf cart & 4 bikes included<br><br>5 bedrooms (4 Kings), 3 porches, chef's kitchen, quartz countertops, BBQ grill, corn hole, open floor plan, coastal furnishings, high-end finishes, large yard, EV Charger, & 2800sf+ of living space make this perfect for your next vacation!<br><br>The space<br><br>Welcome to 'Driftwood Cottage!'<br><br>SLEEPING ACCOMMODATIONS: (Sleeps 18 + 2 on Air Mattress if Needed)<br>-King Bedroom 1 - - First floor king bedroom with en suite bathroom with tub/shower combination<br>-King Bedroom 2 - - Second floor king bedroom with private en suite bathroom with dual vanities, walk-in glass shower, soaking tub, walk-in closet, and private balcony with daybed swing<br>-King bedroom 3 - - Second floor, shared bathroom with tub/shower combination<br>-King bedroom 4 - - Second floor, shared bathroom with tub/shower combination<br>-Bunk room 5 - - 2 sets of twin over full bunks with 2 full trundle beds (6 beds), shared bathroom with tub/shower combination<br><br>There is also a pack n' play and air mattress available for guests' use at the home.<br><br>OTHER FEATURES:<br>-6-Seater LSV/golf cart complimentary! These rent for ~$150/day!<br>-4 bikes INCLUDED!<br>-Outdoor shower<br>-Gas BBQ grill<br>-Fire Pit<br>-Corn Hole<br>-4 beach chairs + 2 umbrellas provided<br>-Private screened-in back porch with TV<br>-Large backyard<br>-Access to NatureWalk community amenities<br>-Less than 1 mile to the beach<br>-Surrounded by state forest + nature trails<br>-Hardwood floors and high-end furnishings<br>-Stainless steel GE appliances<br>-Open-concept white kitchen and living spaces<br>-Quartz countertops<br>-Expansive kitchen island with bar stool seating<br>-Premium mattresses throughout<br>-Fully stocked kitchen<br>-TVs in all bedrooms<br>-Free WiFi<br>-Universal Electric Vehicle Charger (Tesla & J1172) in the garage<br><br>Guest access<br><br>There is parking for 2-3 cars in the driveway, depending on the size of the vehicles. There are additional free parking areas throughout the community.<br><br>Visiting in an electric car? We have you covered, with a private EV Chargers (60amp Tesla & a J1772 adaptor for non-Tesla vehicles- mounted to the wall) in the garage!<br><br>Guests have access to NatureWalk's exceptional community amenities, including the zero-entry lagoon-style pool, seasonally heated lap pool, shaded children's splash area, hot tub, fire pits, BBQ grills, playground, pickleball + volleyball courts, and miles of walking trails through beautiful nature preserves. NatureWalk also offers a private scenic pathway, the Lilly Lane Beach Trail, which leads directly to San Juan Avenue public beach access.<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Pet friendly upon approval. Please inquire for non-refundable pet fee based on breed and size. <br>-Please note we provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Check in is 4:00 PM & check out is 10:00 AM. Late check out / early check in will be subject to another day's rental fees.<br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV/golf cart is not to be driven past the town of Rosemary Beach to the East or the town of WaterColor to the West. Resolving any issue from the LSV/golf cart battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters.<br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV/golf cart or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Naturewalk NEXT to Pool! LSV/Golf Cart & Bikes! 4 Kings! Pet Friendly! Sleeps up to 18!"
        }
      ],
