        "responses": [
          {
            "date": "Mar 29, 2025",
            "id": "7bc04388-a777-4ff3-8510-eec3621584eb",
            "locale": "en_us",
            "response": "Thank you so much for your wonderful review! We’re so glad to hear that your last-minute getaway was such a success and that everyone, especially the boys, enjoyed the bunk room and the pool. We’re also happy the heated pool helped make your March stay more comfortable!\n\nIt’s great to know that our team was able to assist quickly with the golf cart issue and that you found the location convenient for exploring the area. We truly appreciate your kind words and would love to welcome you and your family back for another stay in the future.\n\nThanks again for sharing your experience, and we hope to host you again soon!",
            "user": "VrboOwner"
          }
        ],
        "text": "Our time at this beautiful home was a last minute get away for Spring Break with one of our daughters and her family (husband and 3 boys). There was plenty of room for everyone and the boys loved the bunk room! They also loved being right next to the pool and we were very happy that it was heated as it was rather cool for March! The office and property management staff were professional and helpful when we had a minor golf cart issue (that they resolved quickly). This lovely home is very conveniently located to all the restaurants and shops in the area. We hope to be able to return again soon and would encourage other families or groups to utilize this rental!!",
